{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>תמית</b> Two times in the Masorah: this one and the other: ופותה תמית קנאה. Interpreted in the midrash regarding the assembly of Korach, for it is written of them קנאה — ויקנאו למשה במחנה, these are Datan and Aviram. Because he said את שני בני תמית, it was fulfilled in his two sons, and they are Datan and Aviram." "<b>את שני</b> in gematria: they are Datan and Aviram."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:16.226489649Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}